obably be all over him too i'm  calling that right now this is the  perfect way to mess with kaido not only  will the dragon form reflect his own but  the human form will reflect his greatest  enemy who still haunts him to this day  then in an epic chills bestowing moment  luffy says let's go take back wano and  momo says yeah and that is the end of  this legendary chapter it was strong  throughout but especially with the zorro  and momo moments my mvp for this one  will be momo zoro was epic too but i'm  sure he'll be more epic in subsequent  chapters and momo's decision to take the  risk and try aging himself in the  subsequent intimidating and epic dragon  form is just too much to not give  respect to this kid had little moments  of greatness here and there but now he  finally looks ready to help take wano  back and he's come so far from the kid  who simply cried before kaido the next  few chapters will no doubt keep this  hype train going as always let me know  what you thought of this chapter what  was your favorite moment and who was  your mvp that's the most important  question if you did enjoy this chapter  review and want to keep the chapter  reviews coming the best thing you can do  is channel the pirate king within and  smash that like button with no mercy  remember pirate king smash or roshi's  pass if you haven't make this the video  you subscribe and this is crucial hit  that notification bell to turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  one piece videos and while you wait for  the next chapter to drop feel free to  check out my growing one piece playlist  that includes videos on the yonko  warlords admirals and most recently all  nine mythical zone users and their  powers explained as i said some of these  mythical zones will probably shock you  so definitely check that out link to the  playlist is in the description and until  next time see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you

